                            	  3049:     ; *Signed comparison*:
                            	  3050:     ; If the high speed byte < high max speed byte, then return.
                            	  3051:     ;
                            	  3052:     ; Note that this is not a general purpose signed comparison,
                            	  3053:     ; which would be more complicated. But it works because
                            	  3054:     ; the deviation from 0 of both values is small.
                            	  3055:     ;
