                            	  2140: DrawStatusBarItemsAndEnsureItemSelected:
                            	  2141:     ; Draws the selected item and the sword in the status bar.
                            	  2142:     ; Before drawing the item, it ensures that SelectedItemSlot
                            	  2143:     ; refers to an occupied, equippable item slot.
                            	  2144:     ;
                            	  2145:     ; This accounts for the fallback behavior between potions
                            	  2146:     ; and letters and the two boomerangs.
                            	  2147:     ;
